                <div class="mb-5">
                    <h5>Why Europe Is Becoming a Top Choice for International Students</h5>

                    <p class="mt-3">
                        Europe is home to some of the world’s oldest and most prestigious universities, making it one of the best destinations for higher education.
                    </p>

                    <ul>
                        <li>Globally recognized degrees</li>
                        <li>Affordable tuition fees compared to the USA and UK</li>
                        <li>Scholarships and financial assistance</li>
                        <li>Safe and student-friendly environment</li>
                        <li>Programs taught in English</li>
                        <li>Strong post-study work opportunities</li>
                        <li>Excellent work-life balance</li>
                    </ul>
