                        <li>Advanced education system</li>
                        <li>Practical learning approach</li>
                        <li>Strong research opportunities</li>
                        <li>International student environment</li>
                        <li>Good employment opportunities</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="section mt-5">
